    dmo:severity "Mild" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Hypoglycaemia is defined as blood glucose <4 mmol/L. Prevention and management of hypoglycaemia must be considered when planning and during the perioperative and postoperative phases of surgery in all those at risk (on insulin and insulin secretagogues)" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Prevent hypoglycaemia (blood glucose <4 mmol/L) during all phases of care" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "prevention of hypoglycaemia (blood glucose <4 mmol/L)" ;
