    dmo:evidenceQuote "It is also important to check for the occurrence of and frequency of hypoglycaemia when conducting reviews in the postoperative phase for all individuals with diabetes on sulfonylurea, meglitinides or insulin therapies." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds-21-metabolic-bariatric-surgery-march-2026> .

